\section{Why the recovery is a walk and not a split}{
R's own precedence decides this. \code{~} binds looser than \code{|} and associates
to the left, so \code{y ~ a | p2 ~ b | p3 ~ c} parses as

\preformatted{    ((y ~ (a | p2)) ~ (b | p3)) ~ c}

